RSC-DETR final source package

This package retains code derived from RT-DETR/RT-DETRv2 by lyuwenyu,
DETR by Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates, torchvision by its contributors,
and a model EMA implementation attributed to pytorch-image-models (timm).
Original source-file copyright notices are retained where present.

Packaging modifications include selecting the final dependency closure,
renaming RSC-DETR modules, flattening the two final experiment configurations,
and specializing the final harmonization strategy. These modifications are
documented in docs/FINAL_VERSION_AUDIT.json and docs/VALIDATION.json.

Upstream license texts and attribution links are in LICENSES/ and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This notice does not grant an additional project-wide
license for the RSC-DETR-specific contributions.
